WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:03.649
Every great session starts before the first whistle.

2
00:00:03.829 --> 00:00:07.060
But scattered schedules, payment follow-ups and missing member

3
00:00:07.060 --> 00:00:10.292
details can pull your attention away from coaching.

4
00:00:10.472 --> 00:00:11.778
Meet Courvix.

5
00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:15.677
One brand. Two focused products.

6
00:00:15.857 --> 00:00:19.856
Club Management organizes members, teams and recurring dues.

7
00:00:20.036 --> 00:00:24.173
Personal Training connects clients, appointments and paid session packs.

8
00:00:24.353 --> 00:00:26.605
Choose the workflow that fits your business.

9
00:00:28.083 --> 00:00:32.551
Set up your workspace with your sport, location, currency and time zone.

10
00:00:32.731 --> 00:00:38.053
Review your subscription in Billing. Submitted payments need verification before approval.

11
00:00:38.233 --> 00:00:40.752
Then build the structure your staff will work in.

12
00:00:42.217 --> 00:00:45.962
Open the Club control room for the full operational picture.

13
00:00:46.142 --> 00:00:51.197
See your roster, teams, coaches, upcoming training and payment reviews together.

14
00:00:51.377 --> 00:00:55.141
The attention queue helps you find the records that need a next step.

15
00:00:56.617 --> 00:00:59.425
Choose a member to open their complete overview.

16
00:00:59.605 --> 00:01:05.812
Their profile, team, coach, schedule, attendance and payment records stay connected on one page.

17
00:01:05.992 --> 00:01:10.929
Open a source record to inspect or update the detail, with your existing permissions.

18
00:01:12.417 --> 00:01:18.634
Invite an administrator, coach, member or client using the email they use for ChatGPT.

19
00:01:18.814 --> 00:01:22.505
They accept the single-use invitation and complete their profile.

20
00:01:22.685 --> 00:01:25.905
Each role gets its own view. Coaches and

21
00:01:25.905 --> 00:01:28.722
clients do not receive administrator financial access.

22
00:01:30.217 --> 00:01:35.079
Track recurring dues and review payment submissions against your actual receipts.

23
00:01:35.259 --> 00:01:41.179
An administrator records verification; Courvix does not automatically settle bank transfers.

24
00:01:41.359 --> 00:01:47.394
Configured reminders follow unpaid balances and stop after payment or a declined renewal.

25
00:01:48.883 --> 00:01:52.111
For Personal Training, create an offer for a single visit,

26
00:01:52.111 --> 00:01:55.015
or a pack of four, eight or sixteen sessions.

27
00:01:55.195 --> 00:01:58.231
Set the price, expiry and booking policies clearly, so

28
00:01:58.231 --> 00:02:01.266
clients know what they are buying before they pay.

29
00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:07.827
The client submits their payment reference. You verify the receipt to activate the pack.

30
00:02:08.007 --> 00:02:10.409
Booking reserves one available credit.

31
00:02:10.589 --> 00:02:13.331
Completing the session uses that credit once.

32
00:02:13.511 --> 00:02:16.582
Purchased, available, reserved and used sessions stay visible,

33
00:02:16.582 --> 00:02:20.038
so the next booking starts with a clear balance.

34
00:02:21.517 --> 00:02:27.959
Manage one-to-one appointments and shared classes with assigned trainers, session times and class capacity.

35
00:02:28.139 --> 00:02:32.917
Confirm requests, check availability and keep booking conflicts out of the schedule.

36
00:02:33.097 --> 00:02:37.098
Cancellations and no-shows follow the terms attached to the booking.

37
00:02:38.583 --> 00:02:41.515
After training, record the outcome and progress.

38
00:02:41.695 --> 00:02:47.924
The Training control room brings each client's goals, appointments, packs, balances and progress together.

39
00:02:48.104 --> 00:02:50.818
Use that context to plan the next session,

40
00:02:50.818 --> 00:02:53.532
instead of rebuilding the story from separate tabs.

41
00:02:55.017 --> 00:02:59.230
Managing more than one club location or training workspace? Use the

42
00:02:59.230 --> 00:03:03.444
network view for oversight, then switch into the location you need.

43
00:03:03.624 --> 00:03:07.889
Keep local records and role access clear as your operation grows.

44
00:03:09.383 --> 00:03:13.751
Your people. Your progress. The work behind every session, connected.

45
00:03:13.931 --> 00:03:17.570
Explore the interactive demo as an owner, coach or member.

46
00:03:17.750 --> 00:03:22.571
Choose Club Management or Personal Training, and find your workflow with Courvix.
